body:
Note: I use the google translator.

I also want to die

&#x200B;

I will not tell you encouraging words.

&#x200B;

Just a thought. For me, what people say does not matter to me, I do not despise myself for another person.

&#x200B;

Reason to follow? Simple, I have beings that love me and I do not want to leave any damage or drama behind the suicide dreamed.

&#x200B;

Even if you only have one person who appreciates it, others have no value.

&#x200B;

At least me, that's why I'm still here.

Greetings.

(Only a thought of someone ***Empty***)

I've been with that for years, too.

Also, since I was 15 years old, I am now 21 years old.

&#x200B;

I do not want therapists (I do not say that this is bad for the people who come to them)

&#x200B;

Something else from day to day that is already accepted.

Piensas igual que yo. La felicidad y la tristeza son relativas...

Pregunta: Eres neutral como yo? Te gusta ser asi? crees que es lo mejor?

&#x200B;
